id=usf-cpu-unlock
name=USF CPU Thermal Unlock (Transsion)
version=v1.5.0
versionCode=11
author=drybrine
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/drybrine/usf-cpu-unlock/main/update.json
description=Reversibly disables ONLY the Transsion USF skin-temperature CPU cluster cap (tran_thermal.xml). Bind-mounts a patched config over the original and restarts com.transsion.usf so it reloads through its own no-limit path. Kernel junction protection, skin-control TJ targets, charging, GPU and brightness policy stay stock. Original file is never modified. Verified against USF 26.08.05.001 (Infinix Note 60 X6879).
